        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-21T14:31:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of adding all these release statements, is it feasible to use ScopedByteArrayRW?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 130,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 130,
        "endChar": 84
      },
      "revId": "f84ea617179f3d7a6a2d32815ba6bec671ffbadc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "97f94e7d_2f5333e0",
        "filename": "tests/net/jni/apf_jni.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 130,
      "author": {
        "id": 1385042
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-26T13:58:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are many places use this release statement so I think maybe we can have another commit to do this change.",
      "parentUuid": "729b8f4c_fd27ab32",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 130,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 130,
        "endChar": 84
      },
      "revId": "f84ea617179f3d7a6a2d32815ba6bec671ffbadc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9e4c9329_8d10f342",
        "filename": "tests/net/jni/apf_jni.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 130,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-27T07:59:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason that many places use it is that this CL adds 7 of them :-)\n\nIf you think about it the root of the problem here is that we forgot to release the memory when writing the code. But if we add manual release statements like we\u0027re doing here, we\u0027ll have the same problem: when someone adds a new codepath for this, they may forget to release the memory. If we move to a scoped array instead, that can never happen again.\n\nIs moving to ScopedByteArrayRW a lot of work? If it\u0027s only a couple of lines, then that\u0027s probably better than the 7 release statements that you\u0027re adding in this CL. On the other hand, if it\u0027s 30 lines of unrelated refactoring, then it\u0027s probably best not to do it in this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "97f94e7d_2f5333e0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 130,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 130,
        "endChar": 84
      },
      "revId": "f84ea617179f3d7a6a2d32815ba6bec671ffbadc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "989a07b9_ef156d46",
        "filename": "tests/net/jni/apf_jni.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 227,
      "author": {
